@startuml radio-ripper-tag Bausteinsicht
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

package "CLI" {
    [cli.py] as CLI
    [__main__.py] as MAIN
}

package "Services" {
    [base_processor.py] as BASE
    [processor.py] as PROCESSOR
    [uploader.py] as UPLOADER
    [fingerprint.py] as FP <<ABC>>
    [metadata.py] as META <<ABC>>
    [tagging.py] as TAGGING <<ABC>>
    [lyrics.py] as LYRICS <<ABC>>
    [popularity.py] as POP <<ABC>>
    [repository.py] as REPO <<ABC>>
    [track_processing.py] as TP
    [storage.py] as STORAGE
}

package "Domain" {
    [models.py] as MODELS
}

package "Infrastructure" {
    [config.py] as CONFIG
    [http.py] as HTTP <<ABC>>
    [logging.py] as LOGGING
    [resilience.py] as RESILIENCE
    [errors.py] as ERRORS
}

CLI --> BASE : erzeugt
CLI --> PROCESSOR : erzeugt
CLI --> FP : injiziert
CLI --> META : injiziert
CLI --> TAGGING : injiziert
CLI --> POP : injiziert

PROCESSOR -up-|> BASE : extends
UPLOADER -up-|> BASE : extends

PROCESSOR --> FP : ruft auf
PROCESSOR --> META : ruft auf
PROCESSOR --> TAGGING : ruft auf
PROCESSOR --> TP : delegiert
PROCESSOR --> STORAGE : nutzt
UPLOADER --> TP : delegiert
UPLOADER --> REPO : persistiert

TP --> MODELS : liest/schreibt
TP --> REPO : persistiert
TP --> TAGGING : taggt
TP --> STORAGE : moved

FP --> HTTP : HTTP-Calls (AcoustID)
META --> HTTP : HTTP-Calls (iTunes, MBZ, CAA)
LYRICS --> HTTP : HTTP-Calls (lyrics.ovh)
POP --> HTTP : HTTP-Calls (Deezer)

CONFIG --> ERRORS : wirft
HTTP --> RESILIENCE : retry-Decorator

@enduml
